{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1084685-a-few-questions-needing-answered-before-6-pm-tonight","id":1084685,"title":"A few questions needing answered before 6 pm tonight.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-27T14:02:02-07:00","id":1084685,"title":"A few questions needing answered before 6 pm tonight.","content":"1.If I used say The Boston sourcebook from 1st ed, does most of the stats carry over? I'm looking through it and it seems so. <br /> 2.I have two jaded mages in a mixed group. What non mage thing could I throw at them to give them a run for the money?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T14:08:19-07:00","id":1084688,"title":"","content":"1: Some of the Merits wouldn't translate directly, but the only big difference I can think of offhand is Defense. Athletics now adds directly to Defense, so characters would potentially have higher Defenses.<br /> <br /> Also weapon stats are probably very different.<br /> <br /> 2: Beasts are pretty powerful. There's a number of example ones in the book, having one go all out would probably severely hurt the group. Also angels or demons. A pack of werewolves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T14:11:06-07:00","id":1084692,"title":"","content":"When you say mixed group, do you mean that you're doing crossover with other splats? Because that question has been answered many times before. Basically mages are at they're weakest when surprised. Give them time to prepare and they're terrifying. But beyond that suggestion you need to research this topic. Others have posted on these forums far more thorough and eloquent answers than that.<br /> <br /> If you mean mixed group in another way, you'll need to clarify.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T14:20:19-07:00","id":1084695,"title":"","content":"6pm in what time zone??<br /> <br /> Both questions have been answered already though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T16:10:47-07:00","id":1084747,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/784966-2ed-boston-new-england-setting#post784966\">Here</a> is a 2E conversion for Boston would it help","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"",